<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 2.03 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 2.03 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 2.03 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for May 2			 6,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for May		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to April 28			 6,914</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    2,025</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
